title: metarecord:row-delete
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Delete the field under the cursor

Deletes the field row under the cursor of [[metarecord-detail panel]], after a confirmation — that row only, where `metarecord:field remove` deletes every row equal to a value. An `mfr_*` row is left alone unless ''force'' is checked.
